        {
          "id": 2842333106,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "There was actually never a flags field, since the header already contains the flags. The field at byte 19 was used for padding, and always 0. Since there is now need for a 16-bit protocol field, this byte is used for the higher bits of the protocol field.\n\nI just pushed an update to remove the obsolete hf_addflow_flags.",
